WEBVTT

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:08.450
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:14.960
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:16.790
It's my day!

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:27.370
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:34.780
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:42.150
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:49.560
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:55.330
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.830 --> 00:01:02.470
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:09.980
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:16.120
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:19.190
I just want to walk

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:22.730
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:26.700
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.660 --> 00:01:35.600
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:42.040
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:44.310
It's my day!

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:09.470
<i>I'm in heaven...</i>

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:17.140
<i>Ugh! How did he get here?</i>

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:22.520
<i>What?! What?! What's going on?!</i>

00:02:23.150 --> 00:02:25.720
<i>No! Stop!</i>

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:33.030
What a nightmare!

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:43.870
But starting today...

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:45.910
...I'm going back to the real nightmare.

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:54.980
"The Nightmare of the New Term!!"

00:03:18.770 --> 00:03:19.600
Morning!

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:22.210
You're up early.

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:24.880
Yeah, the new school term
starts today.

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:27.280
You can leave breakfast over there.

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:30.650
You've seemed so happy of late.

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:32.820
Has something pleasant happened?

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:40.020
Oh! That's none of my concern.
I do apologize!

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:42.890
That's all right.

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:47.030
Now for some breakfast!

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:49.530
Yes, sir.

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:55.080
<i>September 2nd, the new school term.</i>

00:03:56.370 --> 00:03:58.610
<i>How I prayed this day 
would never come!</i>

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:06.520
<i>I'm Tsukushi, the weed.
Even when stomped on, I survive.</i>

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:10.720
<i>I'm Tsukushi, the weed.</i>

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:15.260
Tsukushi!

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:19.700
Kazuya!

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:21.530
Morning!

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:25.400
Look at you, Kazuya!
Chauffeur-driven to school!

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:33.980
But what a tacky car!

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:38.680
Well, sure! That's because
I come from new money.

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:43.190
Stop bringing that up!
Nobody would know if you didn't tell them!

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:44.890
Wait, I'm sorry!

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:50.060
Thank you again for the trip to Atami.
My parents and I had a blast.

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:53.260
You're very welcome!
We'll have to do it again!

00:04:54.530 --> 00:04:56.970
That last night was something, huh?

00:04:57.800 --> 00:05:00.200
By the end,
I was getting pretty emotional...

00:05:04.440 --> 00:05:05.150
<i>Don't hate me!</i>

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:10.880
<i>If I hated you,
would I have helped you?</i>

00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:18.120
Huh?!

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:21.760
I built a bridge between us commoners
and the rich folk! With squid!

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:26.830
That's a pretty big deal, I'd say!

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:28.430
Squid?

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:36.940
No one will ever bully me here again!

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:40.470
If only it were that easy, Kazuya...

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:46.110
But Tsukushi! Remember everyone
was eating the squids?

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:48.550
We got soy sauce on our faces 
and laughed together!

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:54.020
I finally felt like
I belonged at Eitoku!

00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:59.790
Um, but still...

00:06:00.990 --> 00:06:03.860
We're all exactly
the same, deep down!

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:14.640
You idiot! You're in the way!
Don't walk in front of us!

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:18.790
My morning's been spoiled
by looking at that loser!

00:06:20.280 --> 00:06:22.250
Kazuya! Are you okay?

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:28.250
K-Kazuya?

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:36.560
It won't all change just like that.

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:46.250
See? My locker's already
full of trash. No change.

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:58.230
Well, Tsukushi, I'll see you later.
If we survive...

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:06.520
Kazuya? Don't be such a wimp!
I'm with you! We won't give up!

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:09.490
Okay...

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:25.010
Thanks, Tsukushi.

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:26.710
I'll try! Bye!

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:34.650
And so our days of fighting begin.

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:56.270
That's Rui Hanazawa playing!

00:08:06.780 --> 00:08:11.190
I wish time could stop 
in this moment...

00:08:22.530 --> 00:08:25.700
This music is so special to me...

00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:00.300
Hey there, little hick Makino.

00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:04.670
Starting again? And so soon?!

00:09:07.970 --> 00:09:11.380
You filled my locker with trash,
didn't you?

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:14.350
That's high-class trash
straight from the Domyoji home.

00:09:14.410 --> 00:09:15.820
Be grateful!

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:38.800
That idiot stole my first kiss!

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:41.590
It makes me angry
just to think of it!

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:43.280
I could just die!

00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:48.650
You jerk!

00:09:52.970 --> 00:09:55.920
That was so worth it!
Did you see her face?

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:57.910
Don't tell me...

00:09:58.220 --> 00:10:00.560
You woke up early for this?

00:10:01.190 --> 00:10:03.510
I thought you came by suspiciously early...

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:08.120
Well? I was up all night planning.
Wasn't it a beauty?

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:14.270
Tsukusa! That was 
basically a child's prank.

00:10:14.810 --> 00:10:17.370
She's clearly crazy about me!

00:10:17.810 --> 00:10:20.810
I'll reel her in, mess her up,
and dump her hard!

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:22.910
You serious?

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:27.480
Pretty serious.

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:30.250
Not like I care about 
her or anything, though.

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:38.300
She loves him?
She's got a strange way of showing it...

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:40.760
I... think he's got it wrong.

00:10:44.230 --> 00:10:45.870
By the way, has anyone seen Rui?

00:10:47.360 --> 00:10:48.810
Did you hear that?!

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:52.230
Makino's trying to
hook up with Domyoji?

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:56.730
We can't even talk to those guys!
Who does she think she is?

00:10:57.610 --> 00:11:00.050
That girl gets under my skin.

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:03.250
Now girls... no need to get upset...

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:08.720
After all, we have this on our side!

00:11:11.430 --> 00:11:16.200
One look, and Tsukasa'll know
what she's really like!

00:11:56.470 --> 00:11:59.340
<i>He won't be there...
He probably won't ever be there again...</i>

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:05.010
<i>If I hated you,
would I have helped you?</i>

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:10.080
<i>If he meant that,
then he'll be there...</i>

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:21.060
Why am I suddenly so nervous?

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:23.630
My knees are shaking...

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:25.330
What a strange feeling...

00:12:38.710 --> 00:12:40.250
Oh well. Too bad.

00:12:40.580 --> 00:12:41.210
Move it.

00:12:43.880 --> 00:12:46.380
What? Did you see a ghost?

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:52.090
Don't scare me like that!

00:12:55.860 --> 00:13:01.830
Scare you? It's conceited of you
to think I would even try.

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:07.870
Conceited? Me?

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:13.010
<i>Why is he being so mean?</i>

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:17.050
Why are you here, anyway?

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:18.520
Huh?

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:20.990
Come sit by me.

00:13:22.180 --> 00:13:23.320
Um! Sure!

00:13:37.130 --> 00:13:38.000
<i>That's better!</i>

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:41.030
<i>Though there's nothing
for us to talk about...</i>

00:13:41.640 --> 00:13:47.240
<i>...but it's peaceful...
I love it when it's like this.</i>

00:13:59.530 --> 00:14:04.390
Um... Wanna try this?

00:14:05.330 --> 00:14:06.430
What is it?

00:14:20.640 --> 00:14:22.680
I'll ask a question,
but you have to answer "no." Okay?

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:26.280
When I come here,
do I bother you?

00:14:26.780 --> 00:14:28.380
No, you're no bother.

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:34.890
Great! So, it's okay if I come here?

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:37.360
What are you so happy about?

00:14:38.090 --> 00:14:39.060
You're strange.

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:41.130
Because...

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:51.140
Where could Rui be now?

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:52.140
Hey, you!

00:14:55.280 --> 00:14:56.640
You know where Rui is?

00:14:57.280 --> 00:14:58.610
Huh?

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:01.780
I asked you, do you know where Rui is?

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:07.590
I saw him walking towards
the emergency exit... I'm sorry!

00:15:08.160 --> 00:15:09.120
The emergency exit?

00:15:09.190 --> 00:15:10.720
Yeah! Forgive me!

00:15:11.530 --> 00:15:15.030
You're so annoying. Stop apologizing!

00:15:16.030 --> 00:15:17.930
Yes! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:20.200
I apologized again!

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:21.800
Sorry for that!

00:15:22.640 --> 00:15:25.310
The emergency exit, huh? He's so weird...

00:15:28.520 --> 00:15:32.680
Domyoji spoke to me and I lived!

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:35.380
Yeah, you got away without a scratch!

00:15:37.820 --> 00:15:40.490
The F4 have really
 calmed down lately, huh?

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:43.720
It used to be they'd kick your ass,
just to be sure.

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:48.760
I thought I wouldn't see you here again.

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:55.570
I thought you hated me,
so I'm really happy.

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:58.740
This was the one ray 
of hope in my life.

00:16:16.220 --> 00:16:17.090
You're exaggerating.

00:16:17.520 --> 00:16:18.420
No, it's true!

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:26.230
Okay, maybe a little... but the time I spend 
here is like my life's greatest treasure.

00:17:06.240 --> 00:17:08.000
Hey, what's with you, Tsukasa?

00:17:09.740 --> 00:17:11.570
You look like you've seen a ghost!

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:14.280
Did you know that Rui and Makino have been 


00:17:14.280 --> 00:17:16.280
meeting out on the emergency stairway?

00:17:16.310 --> 00:17:19.580
You sure? That's bizarre.

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:24.390
It's probably because
he stood up for her the other day.

00:17:24.960 --> 00:17:27.120
No, it goes back further than that.

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:31.460
You know, Makino is
 crazy about Hanazawa.

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:42.700
They meet there on the stairs
every single day.

00:17:43.940 --> 00:17:45.040
You're kidding me!

00:17:46.170 --> 00:17:49.540
It's true. And it gets
pretty hot there sometimes.

00:17:50.280 --> 00:17:54.420
That night in Atami,
we got it all on video.

00:17:57.190 --> 00:17:58.590
Here, take a look.

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:17.570
<i>I'll never understand women.</i>

00:18:19.940 --> 00:18:23.010
<i>They're so stubborn, 
and think only of themselves.</i>

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:26.350
<i>Don't hate me!</i>

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:31.620
<i>No, it's true!</i>

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:38.690
<i>Okay, maybe a little... but the time I spend 
here is like my life's greatest treasure.</i>

00:18:42.460 --> 00:18:48.130
We couldn't stand see her 
stringing you both along!

00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:50.510
We were shocked.

00:18:54.370 --> 00:18:58.550
First she forced herself on you,
then she went straight to Hanazawa...

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:06.220
Hey! My camcorder!

00:19:07.550 --> 00:19:08.590
Oh, no...

00:19:13.260 --> 00:19:14.560
<i>Don't hate me!</i>

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:18.400
It's obvious. Tsukushi is
in love with Rui.

00:19:27.110 --> 00:19:32.180
We saw her following him 
around like a puppy.

00:19:33.510 --> 00:19:36.750
We warned her that
he's already got Shizuka...

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:39.720
...and she got all weepy and ran away!

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:56.570
If she can't have Hanazawa,
she'll settle for you!

00:19:56.600 --> 00:19:58.710
Isn't that awful?

00:20:00.140 --> 00:20:00.700
Right?

00:20:01.240 --> 00:20:04.480
Don't... touch me!!

00:20:09.280 --> 00:20:10.250
Yuriko!

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:12.820
Yuriko? Are you all right?

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:15.520
Tsukusa! It's not cool to hit girls!

00:20:16.220 --> 00:20:19.490
Well, well. Makino Tsukushi's 
really got some nerve...

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:21.830
...trying to manipulate the F4 like this.

00:20:22.460 --> 00:20:27.000
I never got the feeling
she liked Tsukasa, though.

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:31.600
You're right! It's a pretty strange way
to show someone you like them.

00:20:39.180 --> 00:20:40.580
Nobody...

00:20:42.680 --> 00:20:46.150
Nobody has ever made
a fool of me like this...

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:51.450
Oh, please!
Forget about that little hick!

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:55.320
Besides, Rui's with Shizuka, right?

00:20:56.260 --> 00:20:58.630
What would he see in a girl
like Makino?

00:21:00.240 --> 00:21:04.600
Or, are you saying
you're serious about Makino?

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:08.900
Hey, come on. It's not worth it.
Let's go out for a drink, okay?

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:09.940
Stop joking...

00:21:11.340 --> 00:21:12.340
...and get outta my way.

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:23.180
That look in his eyes!

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:27.050
I know... When he looks like that,
he's dangerous.

00:21:40.030 --> 00:21:44.670
Three years ago, he beat up a kid
in our class so bad, he nearly died.

00:21:45.840 --> 00:21:47.310
He had that same look then.

00:21:49.640 --> 00:21:51.240
He could kill someone!

00:22:05.590 --> 00:22:11.660
You let your hair down a little

00:22:13.630 --> 00:22:19.540
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:21.310 --> 00:22:29.420
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:29.650 --> 00:22:37.460
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:37.460 --> 00:22:45.230
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:45.500 --> 00:22:53.370
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:45.500 --> 00:22:53.370
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:53.370 --> 00:23:01.750
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:53.370 --> 00:23:01.750
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:03.550 --> 00:23:11.520
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:11.520 --> 00:23:19.300
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:19.560 --> 00:23:27.470
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:19.560 --> 00:23:27.470
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:27.470 --> 00:23:35.880
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:27.470 --> 00:23:35.880
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:47.690 --> 00:23:48.790
Domyoji! Quit it!

00:23:48.960 --> 00:23:51.190
I'm not kidding!
Get your hands off me!

00:23:52.630 --> 00:23:57.170
He usually pulls a prank and laughs about it,
but he looks different now!

00:23:57.800 --> 00:24:01.200
He was smiling this morning. 
Now he looks dangerous!

00:24:01.870 --> 00:24:04.270
What made him change so quickly?

00:24:05.440 --> 00:24:08.280
Next on Hana Yori Dango:
"Tsukasa Domyoji Snaps!"
